  "notes": [
    "The reset is the Comptroller's _setPriceOracle to this PriceOracleProxy (rule 7: the controller pointing to the code), not the oracle's deployment; the later Comptroller implementation upgrade, market listings and guardian changes are not in the defect or only change the loss size.",
    "Campaign: the attacker's follow-up txs that borrowed further markets against the still-inflated crYUSD collateral; its later sweeps from the attack contract to the EOA are not exploits.",
    "Seven underlyings without DefiLlama prices (RUNE, yvCurve-stETH, HBTC, yvCurve-IronBank, vVSP, ibBTC, yUSD) are valued at Cream's own pre-manipulation getUnderlyingPrice at the block before the anchor times the ETH price loss.mjs used. Distinct from the August 2021 crAMP reentrancy (another defect)."
